repository-code: 'https://github.com/uk-gdad/uk-gdad/'
url: 'https://uk-gdad.github.io'
abstract: >-
  Five documents for every one of the 205 role levels in the UK Government
  Digital and Data Profession Capability Framework: the framework restated as
  plain text, upskilling resources, a continuing professional development
  checklist, practice assessment material, and a skills gap form. 1,025
  documents in all, published as a static website. The role summaries are
  adapted from the framework under the Open Government Licence v3.0; the other
  four documents are written for this repository and are AI-assisted with human
  review.
keywords:
  - UK government
  - digital and data profession
  - capability framework
  - skills framework
  - professional development
  - open government licence
